00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:24.960
original video. So, just as an example,

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:26.839
here's an example of what you shouldn't

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:28.720
do. Let's say your original video is

00:09:26.839 --> 00:09:30.680
about top five best college degrees.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:33.040
Your video at the end should not be,

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:34.720
"Hey, check out the top five best credit

