the end might be check out the top five

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:43.520
worst college degrees, or how to pick

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.480
your dream college degree, or the five

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:47.000
highest paying jobs you can get with the

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.000
highest paying college degrees.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.960
Something like that. Something where

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:53.040
they would likely be interested in that

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:54.400
video if they watched the original one.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:56.080
And then additionally, the thing that

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:57.880
you send them to that might be off the

00:09:56.080 --> 00:10:00.280
platform should also be something that

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:02.320
gives you and the viewer value. So, for

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:04.680
instance, we send people to a live

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:05.760
training. We give tons and tons of value

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.640
to people who attend these live

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:09.720
trainings. And the more value you give

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:11.320
to people, the more value you will get

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:13.000
in return. So, you should always make

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.680
sure that your calls to action are in

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:17.000
your description at the top of your

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.600
description, above the fold, meaning you

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:20.560
don't have to click more in order to see

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:22.600
it. There should be attractive text that

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:24.160
tells people why they should click that.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:26.040
Then you should have the same thing in

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:27.600
