00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:29.560
of your video, you should have an end

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:31.240
screen that pops up and tells them what

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.200
they should watch next. And mistake

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:35.680
number one that people make is either

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:38.760
deleting a video because it's doing bad,

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:40.520
